  m_text: 'OPERATION LINK

    <size=28>Click or drag a tower card to project legal
    sectors</size>

    <size=20><color=#8AA6BF>1 Relay / 2 Single / 3 Slow / 4 Bomb
    / Esc Cancel</color></size>


    LIVE STATUS

    <size=18><color=#D6E6F0>Place
    a relay on any empty ground, then deploy towers inside relay coverage. You can
    drag the deploy cards or use hotkeys 1 / 2 / 3 / 4.</color></size>


    POWER
    GRID

    <size=18><color=#8AA6BF>Relays 0/4  Towers 0/0 online</color></size>

    <size=18><color=#8AA6BF>Load
    0/0</color></size>

    <size=18><color=#FFB870>Place a relay first to open the
    power network.</color></size>'
